      (rho_add_length_le_rbarOfMk (γ := γF) S (σf LGs) (Mkf LGs)).trans (hrf LGs hLGsA).le
    exact hKB γF S hSpl D (σf LGs) (Mkf LGs) p g r N Ac hAcl hr' hsize hn
